7.605
3.02947251E-06
1000.0
0.1
0.054

###
Required parameters
1: absorption coefficient (cm-1)
2: refractive index (real part)
3: distance from source to sample (cm)
4: distance from sample to detector (cm)
5: effective pixel size (um)

examples

// hair C2446, H5165, N736, O1264, S89, density=1.3g/cm3
// energy 9.8keV
#define MU		7.605				/* absorption coefficient (cm-1)*/
#define DELTA	3.02947251E-06		/* refractive index (real part)*/
#define R1		1000.0					/* distance from source to sample (cm) */
#define R2		0.1					/* distance from sample to detector (cm) */
#define P_SIZE	0.054			/* effective pixel size (cm) */

